---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="How Waliya Enterprizes collects and uses your data."
>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-24">
		<h1 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			Privacy Policy for Waliya Enterprizes
		</h1>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			Last updated: November 20, 2026
		</p>

		<h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			1. Information We Collect
		</h2>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			We only collect information you voluntarily provide to us through our contact form, which
			includes your name, email address, and any message you send us. We do not use tracking cookies
			or collect background data.
		</p>

		<h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			2. How We Use Your Information
		</h2>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			The information you provide is used solely to respond to your inquiries and discuss potential
			business services. We use Web3Forms to process form submissions, which means your data is
			securely transmitted to our email inbox. We do not sell or share your data with third parties.
		</p>

		<h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			3. Hosting and Data Security
		</h2>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			Our website is hosted by Vercel. Vercel may collect standard server logs (like IP addresses)
			for security and performance monitoring. We take reasonable measures to protect your personal
			information.
		</p>

		<h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			4. Contact Us
		</h2>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			If you have questions about this policy, please contact us at &nbsp;
			<a
				class="text-primary-green underline hover:text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-green dark:hover:text-dark-text"
				href="mailto:waliya.info@gmail.com"
			>waliya.info@gmail.com</a>.
		</p>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
